{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"verdicts\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"ok\": false,\n      \"why\": \"H4、H5、H12、H13、H14支持欲望加深、珍惜感情以及亲近不足时的温柔与酸楚，却不支持已经获得“直接的身体性满足”，这把身体欲望的强度偷换成了实际满足，也没有充分解释B2中气味、身体感觉、幻想、遗憾与快感交织而令人失去方向的听感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"ok\": true,\n      \"why\": \"H6支持快乐尚在时已经感到无法留住当下的不安，H11与H15则具体支持亲近成为既能温暖自己又会带来难过、仍留在自身的记忆，因此能够解释B3中幸福与美好并未减弱、却已感到时间流逝和当下无法停住的听感，且与已选定的解释一致。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7c26be37-b60a-41c1-98f6-b8e271acf34d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T015235869021Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.094, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T01:53:13.961964+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "18ecab3b7906855adfae17cf300128a5dc9bd425c0f3d3de997bd8ed4bc5fcde", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee